Eigenmath for generated9

Build with native libc and libbio. On amd64, rebuild 6c first for the NaN
comparison fix; see boot/README.md.

    cd /sys/src/cmd/eigenmath
    mk
    mk test
    mk install

    eigenmath
    echo 'd(sin(x),x)' | eigenmath
    eigenmath examples/oscillator

With no files, input comes from the console or a pipe. Enter exit or Ctrl-D
to leave the prompt. See eigenmath(1) for file handling, output and errors.
The terminal port does not draw graphs.

mk test runs upstream selftest, numeric boundary checks and CLI tests.
For more upstream examples, run 6.out test/demotest or 6.out test/misctest;
replace 6 with the architecture's prefix. Runtime tests used amd64.

Sources and licenses: UPSTREAM.
Language reference: https://georgeweigt.github.io/
